{"id":"38ffff953003d9fb","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-countable-delta2-splitting.md","title":"同时避开可数 Δ₂ 上锥的 c.e. 分裂","display":"thm-countable-delta2-splitting — 同时避开可数 Δ₂ 上锥的 c.e. 分裂","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-countable-delta2-splitting","aliases":["20-thm-countable-delta2-splitting"],"display":"thm-countable-delta2-splitting — 同时避开可数 Δ₂ 上锥的 c.e. 分裂","chapter":"7","section":"7.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 7.6.3","source_printed_pages":[161],"source_pdf_pages":[195],"depends_on":["[[20-df-uniform-delta2-sequence]]","[[20-df-maximal-agreement]]","[[20-lem-delta2-preservation]]","[[20-lem-delta2-restraint-limit]]","[[20-thm-single-event-enumeration]]","[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-recursive]]","[[20-df-tred]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-countable-delta2-splitting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-countable-delta2-splitting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-countable-delta2-splitting — 同时避开可数 Δ₂ 上锥的 c.e. 分裂"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 7.6.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>161</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>195</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d4ca35593c6aba92\" href=\"?note=d4ca35593c6aba92\" title=\"20-df-uniform-delta2-sequence\">20-df-uniform-delta2-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"02f37a11ca2f55ac\" href=\"?note=02f37a11ca2f55ac\" title=\"20-df-maximal-agreement\">20-df-maximal-agreement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9a23aa09d0333bb6\" href=\"?note=9a23aa09d0333bb6\" title=\"20-lem-delta2-preservation\">20-lem-delta2-preservation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5152fdccfe1e0c8e\" href=\"?note=5152fdccfe1e0c8e\" title=\"20-lem-delta2-restraint-limit\">20-lem-delta2-restraint-limit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8ec065689fdce567\" href=\"?note=8ec065689fdce567\" title=\"20-thm-single-event-enumeration\">20-thm-single-event-enumeration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathcal E\">\\(B\\in\\mathcal E\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UniformDeltaTwo}(\\vec C)\">\\(\\operatorname{UniformDeltaTwo}(\\vec C)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall j\\ [C_j\\notin\\mathcal R]\">\\(\\forall j\\ [C_j\\notin\\mathcal R]\\)</span>；给定其统一近似函数。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d4ca35593c6aba92\" href=\"?note=d4ca35593c6aba92\" title=\"20-df-uniform-delta2-sequence\">20-df-uniform-delta2-sequence</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"02f37a11ca2f55ac\" href=\"?note=02f37a11ca2f55ac\" title=\"20-df-maximal-agreement\">20-df-maximal-agreement</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"9a23aa09d0333bb6\" href=\"?note=9a23aa09d0333bb6\" title=\"20-lem-delta2-preservation\">20-lem-delta2-preservation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"5152fdccfe1e0c8e\" href=\"?note=5152fdccfe1e0c8e\" title=\"20-lem-delta2-restraint-limit\">20-lem-delta2-restraint-limit</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"8ec065689fdce567\" href=\"?note=8ec065689fdce567\" title=\"20-thm-single-event-enumeration\">20-thm-single-event-enumeration</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}countable\\text{-}delta2\\text{-}splitting}\\vdash\n\\exists A_0,A_1\\in\\mathcal E\\ [A_0\\cap A_1=\\varnothing\\land A_0\\cup A_1=B\\land\\forall i&lt;2\\ \\forall j\\ [C_j\\not\\le_TA_i]].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}countable\\text{-}delta2\\text{-}splitting}\\vdash\n\\exists A_0,A_1\\in\\mathcal E\\ [A_0\\cap A_1=\\varnothing\\land A_0\\cup A_1=B\\land\\forall i&lt;2\\ \\forall j\\ [C_j\\not\\le_TA_i]].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 每阶段至多新增一个元素的可计算枚举。按固定有效次序给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(e,i,j)\">\\((e,i,j)\\)</span> 编号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>，为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^{A_i}\\ne\\chi_{C_j}\">\\(\\Phi_e^{A_i}\\ne\\chi_{C_j}\\)</span> 用该目标的历史最大一致长度设限制。阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 只执行和比较已激活的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\le s\">\\(k\\le s\\)</span>，所以即使目标编号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 无界，每一步也只检查有限多个需求。新激活需求的历史最大值可由已保存的有限阶段数据重算；固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 在激活前只有有限阶段，这些阶段的潜在损伤仍是有限的。新元素 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 到来时，找出它若被放入对应一边就会穿过其限制的最优先需求，改放到另一边；若没有，则放到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_0\">\\(A_0\\)</span>。所有阶段可计算，每个元素只分配一次。</p>\n<p>归纳某个需求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>。已知所有更高需求的限制最终固定，取超过它们的有限界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>，再等到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\upharpoonright R\">\\(B\\upharpoonright R\\)</span> 的枚举稳定且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\ge k\">\\(s\\ge k\\)</span>。此后 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 与全部更高需求都已激活，新元素均不会穿过更高限制；若它威胁 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>，分配规则必将它放到另一边，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 不再受损伤。两个历史保持引理于是给出回避结论和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 自己的有限稳定限制，完成归纳。</p>\n<p>这是 c.e. 目标分裂的 Δ₂ 扩展。这里只陈述同时锥回避；不把前一节特有的低性论证未经展开地附加上来。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 7.6.3；印刷页 161；PDF 第 195 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-uniform-delta2-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"d4ca35593c6aba92","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-uniform-delta2-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-maximal-agreement","status":"resolved","id":"02f37a11ca2f55ac","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-maximal-agreement]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-delta2-prese